0090 30C901DE         (        ccide.asm):00327                             leax      Sect0,u             Point to start of buffer again
0094 E684             (        ccide.asm):00328                             ldb       ,x                  Get general config low byte
0096 C480             (        ccide.asm):00329                             andb      #%10000000          Removable cartridge bit set?
